+</style>
+</head>
+<body>
+<header class="shell topbar"><a class="brand" href="index.html" aria-label="Relay home"><span class="mark" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>relay</a><nav class="nav" aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#compare">Compare plans</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a><a class="nav-cta" href="#plans">Get started</a></nav></header>
+<main>
+<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow"><span class="dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Simple, thoughtful pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">Good work starts<br>with good conversation.</h1><p>Bring your team together without adding noise. Pick a plan that fits today, and change it whenever you grow.</p><div class="billing"><span class="billing-label" id="monthly-label">Monthly</span><button class="switch" type="button" role="switch" aria-checked="false" aria-label="Yearly billing" aria-describedby="billing-note"><span></span></button><span class="billing-label" id="yearly-label">Yearly</span><span class="save" id="billing-note">Save 20%</span></div></section>
+<section class="shell plans" id="plans" aria-label="Pricing plans">
+<article class="plan"><h2>Free</h2><p class="desc">A calmer place to start working together.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="0" data-year="0">$0</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed">Always free</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Free">Get started free</a><div class="rule"></div><p class="list-label">Includes:</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Up to 10 teammates</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 1:1 and group messaging</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 5 GB shared file storage</li></ul></article>
+<article class="plan featured"><span class="badge">MOST POPULAR</span><h2>Team</h2><p class="desc">Everything your growing team needs to click.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="8" data-year="6.40">$8</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed" data-bill="Team">Billed monthly</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Team">Start your free trial</a><div class="rule"></div><p class="list-label">Everything in Free, plus:</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Unlimited message history</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Unlimited integrations</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> 100 GB shared storage</li></ul></article>
+<article class="plan"><h2>Business</h2><p class="desc">More control and support for bigger teams.</p><div class="price"><span class="amount" data-month="15" data-year="12">$15</span><span class="period">/ user / month</span></div><div class="billed" data-bill="Business">Billed monthly</div><a class="cta" href="mailto:hello@relay.example?subject=Relay%20Business">Talk to our team</a><div class="rule"></div><p class="list-label">Everything in Team, plus:</p><ul class="features"><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> SAML single sign-on</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Advanced admin controls</li><li><span class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</span> Priority support</li></ul></article></section>
+<section class="section shell" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="compare-title">Compare plans</h2><p>All the details, side by side.</p></div><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Plan feature comparison" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Feature</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Team members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shared storage</th><td>5 GB</td><td>100 GB</td><td>1 TB</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">App integrations</th><td>5</td><td class="yes">Unlimited</td><td class="yes">Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Guest access</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓ <span class="sr-only">Included</span></td><td class="yes">✓ <span class="sr-only">Included</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Single sign-on (SAML)</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓ <span class="sr-only">Included</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓ <span class="sr-only">Included</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
+<section class="section shell" id="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="faq-title">Questions, answered.</h2><p>A few things teams often ask.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><p>Yes. Team and Business plans include a 14-day free trial. No credit card is needed to get started.</p></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><p>Choose yearly billing and pay for the year upfront at 20% less than the monthly rate. You can change your plan at any time.</p></details><details><summary>Can I change plans later?</summary><p>Absolutely. Upgrade or downgrade whenever your team's needs change. Any billing adjustment is prorated.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when my trial ends?</summary><p>Choose a paid plan to keep premium features, or move to Free. Your team's messages remain available.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving my team?</summary><p>Yes. Our team can help import your conversations and get everyone settled in Relay.</p></details></div></section>
+</main><footer class="footer"><div class="shell footer-inner"><span>© 2025 Relay. Better work, together.</span><a href="mailto:hello@relay.example">Questions? Talk to us</a></div></footer>
+<script>
+(() => {
+ const toggle = document.querySelector('.switch');
+ const amounts = document.querySelectorAll('.amount');
+ const bills = document.querySelectorAll('[data-bill]');
+ function setBilling(yearly) {
+  toggle.setAttribute('aria-checked', String(yearly));
+  amounts.forEach(price => { const value = yearly ? price.dataset.year : price.dataset.month; price.textContent = '$' + (Number(value) % 1 ? Number(value).toFixed(2) : value); });
+  bills.forEach(label => { label.textContent = yearly ? 'Billed annually' : 'Billed monthly'; });
+ }
+ toggle.addEventListener('click', () => setBilling(toggle.getAttribute('aria-checked') !== 'true'));
+ document.querySelectorAll('.billing-label').forEach((label, index) => label.addEventListener('click', () => setBilling(index === 1)));
+})();
+</script>
+</body></html>
